# INVWINRB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the loans
# report and the labels at level 1, with PAGE20.CFG's labels 20 lines
# apart.  The loans report of the overdue loans only, as of a date
# typed, shows no records in the preview.  An item label for an item
# that does not exist is refused on its field; one for an item that does
# shows in the preview.  The item labels of every item fill more than
# two of the preview's screens: PgDn moves a screen, and again up to the
# last screen, PgUp a screen back, End to the last screen and Home to
# the first, Down and Up a line.  With the frame maximized, its edges
# past the screen's, the bin labels show the codes in a preview over the
# screen alone; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRB.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
K ALT-R L
S LOANS
K SPACE TAB
T 2026-12-31
K TAB
T S
K ENTER
S NOLOANS
K ESC ESC
K ALT-R T
K ALT-E
T 99
K ALT-O
T S
K ENTER
S NOITEM
K BS BS
T 3
K ENTER
S ONE
K ESC
K ALT-E BS
K ENTER
S LABELS
K PGDN
S PGDN
K PGDN
S PGDN2
K PGUP
S PGUP
K END
S END
K HOME DOWN DOWN UP
S DOWN
K ESC ESC
K ALT-SPACE X
K ALT-R B
K ALT-O
T S
K ENTER
S BINS
K ESC ESC
K ALT-F X
